        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lloyd Daly and associates Limited are delighted to bring no 13 Farmleigh close to the market. Ideally situated in this extremely popular location Farmleigh woods development, enjoying beautiful tree lined avenues and manicured grounds in a idyllic setting lying between Farmleigh house, the phoenix park and Castleknock village comes this 5-bedroom townhouse. This fine family home is laid out over 3 floors. The home comprises of 213 sq metres. At ground level an entrance lobby with tiled flooring leads to a large entrance hallway. Off the hallway there is a spacious Livingroom with a limestone fireplace and gas fire inset. Double doors lead to a beautiful light filed open plan kitchen/dining area with all a large island unit. Double doors lead out to a landscaped rear garden, finally a guest wc completes the superb ground floor accommodation. Returning to the first floor there is a spacious Livingroom. This room features solid oak flooring a natural stone fireplace with a gas fire. The master bedroom suite spans the entire width of the house and overlooks the rear garden and features built in wardrobes and carpet flooring. The master ensuite is fully tiled with a shower whb + w.c. The first-floor entrance hallway can be accessed from the exterior granite steps which lead up from the ground floor level. On the second floor, you will find four further bedrooms Two doubles, one ensuite and two single bedrooms. Finally, a well-appointed family bathroom completes this floor. Outside-Landcaped Garden Located off white’s road,Farmleigh woods is situated adjacent to the phoenix park and within a few minute’s walk of Castleknock village and its wealth of amenities. Mount Sackville is situated within a 10-minute walk and Castleknock college is just across the road. There are several excellent golf courses in the vicinity such as Luttrell town castle and country club and Castleknock golf and country club to name but a few as well as a number of sports and social clubs. The m50 is within easy reach to all the major road networks, and easy reach to Dublin airport and the city centre is only 8km away. Accommodation: Ground floor Entrance lobby: 1.92m x 1.17m-Entrance lobby with floors and door to the entrance hallway Entrance hallway- 6.8m x 2.6m-Large Entrance Hall with downstairs w.c,wooden floor, built in storage and understairs storage Lounge-6.2m x 3.9m-Large Livingroom with bay window, wooden floor and diuble doors to open plan kitchen/living/Dining area. Ground Floor: Kitchen/living/dining area: 8.4m x 6.2m -extended open plan kitchen /living and dining room with a modern fitted kitchen with all the major appliances built in.The leading back door opens up to a landscaped rear garden. First floor: Livingroom:5.4m x 3.67m-livingroom with limestone fireplace, gas fire by window and solid wood floor Bedroom 1: 6.2m x 4.7m-Large double bedroom, spanning full width of the house, with ensuite,built in wardrobes and carpet flooring Ensuite: 3.49m x 1.35-Full tiled ensuite with bath, shower wc and whb. Second Floor: Bedroom 2 – 4.26mx 3.28m-To the front, double bedroom with built in wardrobes, carpet floor and double doors to balcony. Ensuite: 2.14m x 1.69m-Fully tiled with shower wc+ whb Bedroom 3:3.22m x 2.52m-To the rear, double bedroom with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring Bedroom 4: 3.22m x 2.52m-To the rear, double bedroom with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring. Bedroom 5: 3.14m x 2.32m-To the front, single bedroom with built in presses and carpet flooring Bathroom: 2.18m x 1.9m-Fully tiled bathroom with bath,wc,whb"
      },
